    "message": "The VAT breakdown at {.} is categorised \"K\" (intra-community supply) and states no exemption reason: neither a reason text (BT-120) nor a reason code (BT-121) is there.",
    "source": "EN 16931-1, 6.4.3.4.5, Table 10, BR-IC-10",
    "note": "The statement names the meaning of the reason as well as its presence: a reason code that means this category, or the reason text of this category in any language. What is asked here is the presence of one of the two, because that is what the official validation artefacts ask and that is what the ecosystem validates against; which reason is the right one for a category is left to the rule packs that carry a controlled vocabulary for it."
